+/* Lazily open the dependency file. init_fd() runs as an ELF constructor,
+ * which on OpenHarmony happens *after* the loader and some other early
+ * constructors have already opened files. Those events arrive with depfd
+ * still -1, so the descriptor has to be created on first use rather than
+ * up-front. Returns 0 on success, -1 on error.
